{"2789680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hello Neighbor 3", "steam_appid": 2789680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living town residents</strong> - Each character is simulated in real-time, independently of the player. Citizens try to reach their own goals even if the player is not around. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of choice</strong> - Approach your goals with curiosity and experimentation, to create unique solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental manipulation</strong> - Practically anything you see can be used one way or another. Interact with the objects and characters to create new possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infiltration gameplay</strong> - Sneak, stack boxes, break windows and find unique ways to reach places that seem impossible to access.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy &amp; eerie town</strong> - Explore a familiar yet at the same time uneasy town where everyday life exists with the unknown side by side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works as your first game!</strong> - New to the series? No worries! This game is designed so gameplay and story can be easily understood without prior experience with Hello Neighbor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth for those who know</strong> - If you have played Hello Neighbor before, you will find extra depth in the story and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/2175734e8ee0be1cf8ad79b5cd4a3b28.poster.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/2175734e8ee0be1cf8ad79b5cd4a3b28.webm?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/2175734e8ee0be1cf8ad79b5cd4a3b28.mp4?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/29e29c6790c4852633360c2fa7bea025.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in Raven Brooks in search of a missing employee - the only person who knows the whereabouts of a critical report. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locals made it clear: they don’t trust the corporation you represent and you are not welcome here. Soon you realize that disappearances are common in Raven Brooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/fbc8145818b4356d923d4862451a64a1.poster.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/fbc8145818b4356d923d4862451a64a1.webm?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/fbc8145818b4356d923d4862451a64a1.mp4?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/4267838608dc9737c6539fe880630e39.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raven Brooks lives its own life. Residents follow their goals, change things and interact with each other whether you are there or not. Learn how everything works and use it to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/92aa0b8867c773b9638256f876ce31dc.poster.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/92aa0b8867c773b9638256f876ce31dc.webm?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/92aa0b8867c773b9638256f876ce31dc.mp4?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/a7d663222b4ba9e37ba3d4f62e3f875f.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak into houses, run through backyards and climb rooftops to reach your goals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the environment and manipulate characters to create opportunities that weren't there before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Raven Brooks, there’s always multiple ways to reach your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/095ff83e010fd72352344e47b0337fbf.poster.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/095ff83e010fd72352344e47b0337fbf.webm?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/095ff83e010fd72352344e47b0337fbf.mp4?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/3053f4da2583fe035f02735b0a4b145e.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events in the town unfold within a limited timeframe. When time runs out, the day rewinds - but what you’ve learned stays with you. This knowledge opens new possibilities, outcomes and ways to explore mysteries this town hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/75d63089c9317e830339c8679f47d165.poster.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/75d63089c9317e830339c8679f47d165.webm?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/75d63089c9317e830339c8679f47d165.mp4?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you explore, the more Raven Brooks reveals.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living town residents</strong> - Each character is simulated in real-time, independently of the player. Citizens try to reach their own goals even if the player is not around. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of choice</strong> - Approach your goals with curiosity and experimentation, to create unique solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental manipulation</strong> - Practically anything you see can be used one way or another. Interact with the objects and characters to create new possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infiltration gameplay</strong> - Sneak, stack boxes, break windows and find unique ways to reach places that seem impossible to access.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy &amp; eerie town</strong> - Explore a familiar yet at the same time uneasy town where everyday life exists with the unknown side by side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works as your first game!</strong> - New to the series? No worries! This game is designed so gameplay and story can be easily understood without prior experience with Hello Neighbor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth for those who know</strong> - If you have played Hello Neighbor before, you will find extra depth in the story and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/2175734e8ee0be1cf8ad79b5cd4a3b28.poster.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/2175734e8ee0be1cf8ad79b5cd4a3b28.webm?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/2175734e8ee0be1cf8ad79b5cd4a3b28.mp4?t=1776438541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/29e29c6790c4852633360c2fa7bea025.avif?t=1776438541\" width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in Raven Brooks in search of a missing employee - the only person who knows the whereabouts of a critical report. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locals made it clear: they don’t trust the corporation you represent and you are not welcome here. Soon you realize that disappearances are common in Raven Brooks.